  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights and Social Development Support (HRSD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides a regional approach to the protection and promotion of human rights and social inclusion in Pacific island countries and territories.  It will provide support directly to the newly formed Human Rights and Social Development (HRSD) division of the Pacific Community to provide culturally and contextually grounded technical assistance that aims to advance human rights, gender equality, social inclusion, youth development and cultural development in Pacific island countries and territories.  This investments is valued at $7.7million for a period of 4.5years.</narrative>
  </description>
